cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Kuwait Dust and Soiling Atlas: monthly aerosol optical depth and relative PV soiling exposure, 2015 to present"
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - name: "Mizan Energy Engineering"
    website: "https://mizan-energy.com"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ahmedelshazly27/mizan-kuwait-dust-atlas"
url: "https://mizan-energy.com/research/kuwait-dust-atlas"
keywords:
  - aerosol optical depth
  - MAIAC
  - MCD19A2
  - dust
  - photovoltaic soiling
  - Kuwait
  - AERONET
abstract: >-
  Monthly mean aerosol optical depth at 550 nm over Kuwait on a 0.01 degree
  grid, derived from MODIS MAIAC (MCD19A2 C6.1), with a 2015-2025
  climatology, a simple relative soiling-exposure index, and validation
  against AERONET Level 2.0 at Shagaya Park and Kuwait University. Code is
  MIT licensed; data are CC BY 4.0.
